meta {
  name: Member tags - Remove a member
  type: http
  seq: 212
}

delete {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/member-tags/<tag cuid>/members/<user cuid>
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Takes the tag off a member (#1389). A member who does not have the tag gives a 404. Returns 204. Token ability: member-tags:write. The add and the remove of a tag on a member share a limit of 10 requests a minute for each account: 429 after it.
}
